# DDT — single shared discussion DB (Option A). Lives as ONE real file at the
# main checkout root; worktrees symlink to it. Never committed (binary SQLite
# cannot be merged across parallel worktrees — see DISCUSSIONS.md).
DISCUSSIONS.db
DISCUSSIONS.db-wal
DISCUSSIONS.db-shm

# Rule 17 store layer (ported 2026-10-19): ONE combined store.db lives in the
# in-project db-store worktree (branch db-store); `store` is a symlink to it.
# The physical store.db is committed ONLY on the db-store branch.
/store
/db-store/